                <pb facs="0877" n="791" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg791"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bowen to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram —Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-12-10"><hi rendition="#italic">December 10,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Bowen reports that he has been informed by President Castro that all Germans
                    and British who were arrested have been released.)</p>
            </div>
